title: 주3_수_1교시_도서관_신아산_영문
---
<<show san_idle>>
(As soon as I arrive at the library, I see ASan furiously typing away at a computer.)
{name()}: Oh? Hey, ASan!
ASan: ...........
{name()}: Whatcha doin'?
<<play san_sound>>
<<show san_shock>>
ASan: GAH! You scared me!!!!!!!!
ASan: Professor Young-Jun Kim's assignment is due today.
ASan: So, I already submitted it four days ago, but I've been reopening the code every day just in case there's an error—
{name()}: ...Wait, what?
ASan: I said, I'm checking my code.
{name()}: No, not that...
{name()}: You said the deadline is TODAY?????
<<show san_neg>>
<<play 신아산_허>>
ASan: You're just finding that out NOW?!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
{name()}: I, I need to get my laptop out first.
ASan: Geez. You really are something else....
<<choice 주3_수_1교시_도서관_신아산_긍정1_영문 "Yes... please help me..." 주3_수_1교시_도서관_신아산_부정1_영문 "Psh~ I can totally finish this starting now.">>
ASan: Well, want me to help?
===

title: 주3_수_1교시_도서관_신아산_긍정1_영문
---
{name()}: Yes... please help me...
ASan: Fine.. I shall show you some mercy this once.
ASan: You at least know Linear Algebra, right?
{name()}: Linear Algebra? Is that like... drawing lines in a math book?
<<show san_neg2>>
<<change lvSan -5>>
<<dislike 신아산>>
<<play 신아산_허>>
ASan: ARE YOU INSANE???? IT'S NOT ABOUT DRAWING LINES!!!! It's about vectors and matrices!
(The assignment session, which started with ASan's scolding, barely finished with a successful submission with only 59 seconds left on the clock.)
<<show san_idle>>
ASan: Phew...
ASan: We somehow got it done.
ASan: Helping you with your work completely drained my soul.
ASan: .....
<<show san_neg2>>
ASan: I'm going to have to get something out of you for this!!!!!!!
<<show san_idle>>
<<choice 주3_수_1교시_도서관_신아산_긍정2_영문 "O-of course, I'm ready to pay you back." 주3_수_1교시_도서관_신아산_부정2_영문 "Wait, what?????" true>>
ASan: You're ready for the consequences, right????????
===

